  "output": "1 ['Latte', 'Mocha', 'Tea', 'Chai']\n2 ['Latte', 'Flat white', 'Mocha', 'Tea', 'Chai']\n3 ['Latte', 'Flat white', 'Mocha', 'Chai']\n4 ['Cortado', 'Flat white', 'Mocha', 'Chai']\n5 IndexError: pop index out of range\n6 ['Cortado', 'Flat white', 'Mocha'] returned Chai\n7 ['Cortado', 'Flat white', 'Mocha', 'Mocha']\n8 ['Cortado', 'Flat white', 'Mocha'] (first Mocha removed)\n9 ['Flat white', 'Mocha'] returned Cortado\n10 ['Flat white']",
